        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLBCA, Crystal Baguette Knob with Soleil Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baguette Crystal Knob with Soleil Rosette is available in either amber or clear crystal. The Soleil Rosette comes in your choice of finish color. This Crystal Baguette Knob with Soleil Rosette will fit on most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLBCA Soleil Rosette with Baguette Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baguette Knob with Soleil Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: 24% Lead Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLBCC-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLBCC Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
