                "title": "Baguette Crystal Knob with Soleil Rosette",
                "description": "The Baguette Crystal Knob with Soleil Rosette is available in either amber or clear crystal. The Soleil Rosette comes in your choice of finish color. This Crystal Baguette Knob with Soleil Rosette will fit on most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
